<title>GERMANY: Sixt AG details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Sixt AG details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>PULLACH, Germany 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    46.3    up 67 pct</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	44.20   vs 27.10 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend (ordinary shares)	     14	vs 14 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend (pref shares)		   15	vs 15 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car rental group is Sixt AG.</p>
<p>Sixt said its net profit had risen 112 percent but did not provide a figure. It also said the first two months of 1997 had shown double digit sales growth.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
